description': "OpenAPI3 discriminators are enabled and discriminatorContext.isActive() returns true, but no discriminator match was found during schema iteration. After the loop the method must return the specific 'no alternative could be chosen' message."}]}, {'group': 'Final block – allErrors empty triggers state.setMatchedNode(true)', 'cases': [{'input': [{'parameter': 'executionContext', 'value': 'mockExecutionContext_allSuccess'}, {'parameter': 'node', 'value': 'mockNode_object'}, {'parameter': 'rootNode', 'value': 'mockRootNode_object'}, {'parameter': 'instanceLocation', 'value': 'mockInstanceLocation_root'}], 'expected': 'empty Set<ValidationMessage> and verifier that executionContext.getValidatorState().setMatchedNode(true) was called once', 'description': 'All subschemas validate without errors, resulting in an empty allErrors set. The finally block must set the validator state matchedNode flag to true and merge the dynamic scopes.'}]}]
